ic\\\">these</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about things in a general or specific way.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read about museum exhibits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write down items in an exhibit.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le07ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "0200", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Aunt Nelly, let's look at  another painting. Doesn't that one look interesting? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Yes. In general, Indian art can be divided into three groups: the senses, the emotions, and the spirit. Shall we go that way? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, there's a jewelry display there. I want to check it out!"}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "22000", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: India is well-known for their beautiful jewelry and  textiles. Look here, Vanessa. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did a jeweler make this? How'd they do that? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: An Indian jeweler can create jewelry using century-old techniques."}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "37000", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! Are there any scarves over there?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Let's take a look. Those look like shawls. India is famous for its beautiful silk, wool, and cotton\ntextiles, including these colorful shawls from the Kashmir